    "LMU (v1.2+) native shared memory 'LMU_Data' layout, as a machine-readable spec.",
    "Reconstructed from independent public implementations (no official header was available):",
    "TinyPedal/pyLMUSharedMemory lmu_data.py @e9b71b6 (MIT) and Swizzjack/lmu-pitwall",
    "bridge/src/shared_memory @a171b80 (MIT) agree on every struct; the embedded V01 records also",
    "match this project's own rF2 structs (rf2data.py / RF2Data.Generated.cs). TinyPedal (GPL-3.0)",
    "was consulted for behaviour only. Only layout facts are used here; no code was copied.",
    "Checked by tools/lmu_native_blob.py verify-spec (pack(4) offsets, sizes, rf2data.py prefix)",
    "and read by the C# reader simhub/src/TeamRadio56.Core/Telemetry/LmuNativeReader.cs.",
